#: includes/addons_help.php:89
msgid "A license that expires stops the automatic updates too."
msgstr ""

#: includes/addons_help.php:90
msgid "The toggle stays as it is, and no update arrives, because the store serves none for an expired license. The row and the plugin update notice say which license it is and what is missing."
msgstr ""

